  "On, the background follows whichever card you're pointing at or have selected. Off, it only changes when you actually open something — steadier on a long list, where sweeping across a row otherwise repaints the whole window card by card.": "Yanggen mababa, i background ha dalalak i card ni un a'atan pat un ayek. Yanggen mapuno', ha tulaika ha' anai un baba magahet un kosas — mås kalmådo gi anåkko' na lista, sa' yanggen un hånao gi un liñia ha na'nuebu i entero na window kada card.",
  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "Yanggen mababa, i app gaige gi hilo' i litratu-mu, ya i litratun titulu ha tampe anai gaige hao gi un peliku'la pat serie. Yanggen mapuno', i litratu ha sågåyi i lugåt-ña ya taya' nai ha tampe.",
  "One colour, and Material's own generator works out the rest of the palette from it.": "Un kulot ha', ya i generator-ña Material ha kalkula i pumalu na palette ginen enao.",
  "One earlier episode in this season is still unwatched.": "Guaha un episodio antes gi este na season ni ti maegga' trabiha.",
  "One earlier season is still unwatched.": "Guaha un season antes ni ti maegga' trabiha.",
  "One-off or monthly, from any card or PayPal. Ko-fi takes no cut of it.": "Un biåhi ha' pat kada mes, ginen håfa na katta pat PayPal. Ti mañuñule' pattes-ña i Ko-fi.",
  "Only download on Wi-Fi": "Na'tunok gi Wi-Fi ha'",
  "Only downloaded subtitles can be synced; the file's own tracks already match it.": "I subtitulu ni manna'tunok ha' siña ma sync; i track siha gi fail parehu ha' esta.",
  "Only needed if the app stops loading artwork and titles. Create one free under your TMDB account settings, API, “API Read Access Token”. It is kept out of backup files.": "Nesesita ha' yanggen ha påra i app manna'hålom litratu yan titulu. Fa'tinas uno debåtde gi settings kuentå-mu gi TMDB, API, “API Read Access Token”. Ti ma pega gi backup fail.",
