  "Rides the volume for you, so the quiet lines come up and the loud scenes stop making you reach for the remote. This is what every film starts with — the player's own Audio panel changes the film you are watching and nothing else.": "Ha kontrola i bos para hågu, pues i fino' mamatkilu siha manhuyong ya i eskena metgot ti u na'fanmaneha hao ni remote. Este i tutuhon kada mubi — i mismo panet Audio gi player ha tulaika ha' i mubi ni unlili'e' på'go.",
  "Right now": "På'go ha'",
