  "Try again": "Chagi ta'lo",
  "Turn subtitles on by themselves whenever a film starts, in the language you pick here.": "Na'gaige i subtitulu siha maisa yanggen matutuhon i mubi, gi lengguåhi ni un ayek guini.",
  "Turns off the effects that cost the most to draw: the frosted blur behind the sidebar and menus, the blur on the background art, and the fades and slides that play as things appear or take focus. Everything stays where it was and nothing is hidden — it stops moving and goes crisp instead. Loading spinners keep turning.": "Ha puno' i effect siha ni mås dångkulo i gastu-ña: i frosted blur gi tatten i sidebar yan menu, i blur gi background art, yan i fade yan slide anai manmåtto pat manman-focus i kosas. Todu ha sågåyi i lugåt-ña ya taya' ma na'atok — ha påra ha' i kalamten ya ha na'klåru. I loading spinner ha sigi ha' bumira.",
  "Type in the search box to find movies and shows.": "Tuge' gi search box para un sodda' peliku'la yan serie.",
  "Unmute (m)": "Na'la'la' i sonido (m)",
  "Unreadable": "Ti siña ma taitai",
  "Untitled": "Taya' titulu",
  "Upcoming": "Para u måtto",
  "Update now": "Update på'go",
  "Updates": "Update siha",
  "Updates are checked in the installed app, not here.": "Ma chek i update gi app ni mainstala, ti guini.",
  "Upload": "Upload",
  "Use default": "Usa i default",
  "Use the usual settings": "Usa i kustumbren settings",
  "Use this colour": "Usa este na kulot",
  "Using the usual audio settings": "Ma'usasa i kustumbren settings audio",
  "Ventic asks a source for {movie}, or {series}, and expects a {streams} array back. Add several and their results are merged, with duplicates dropped and earlier sources preferred.": "Si Ventic ha faisen i source put {movie}, pat {series}, ya ha nangga un {streams} na array tåtte. Na'hålom meggai ya ma na'unu i rispuesta-ñiha, ma na'suha i doble, ya i fine'nana na source mås ma prefiere.",
  "Ventic downloads the new package and Android asks you to confirm the install. It is signed with the same key as the copy you have, so it upgrades in place and keeps your library.": "Ha na'tunok i Ventic i nuebu na package ya i Android ha faisen hao para un konfitma i instalasion. Ma fitma ni parehu na key yan i kopiå-mu, pot enao ha upgrade gi lugåt-ña ya ha adahi i library-mu.",
  "Ventic has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.": "Taya' source ma pega giya Ventic, pot enao taya' lugåt para u aligao. Siña ha' un play un magnet pat un torrent fail ni un baba maisa.",
  "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "Si Ventic taya' ha host na kontenidu, taya' ha index, ya måtto ha' taya' source ma pega. Un BitTorrent client yan un player: ha chule' ha' håfa un fanu'i gue', ginen i server siha ni un na'hålom maisa.",
  "Ventic is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.": "Si Ventic MIT na lisensia. I komponente siha ni ha usa ma adahi i kondision-ñiha maisa, gaige gi lista gi sanhilo'; gi Windows i mpv ni gaige GPL na software ya i lisensia-ña yan i ofresi-ña source gaige gi fi'on i executable i app.",
  "Ventic is free, has no ads, no account and nothing to sell. It costs money to sign, host and keep running — a donation is what covers that, and nothing in the app changes whether you give one or not.": "Libre i Ventic, taya' anunsio, taya' account, yan taya' para mabende. Guaha kostoña i mafitma, i mana'sågayi, yan i mana'sisigi macho'cho' — i nina'i ha tampe este, ya taya' ni ha tulaika gi app kao un na'i pat åhe'.",
  "Ventic is up to date.": "Nuebu si Ventic.",
  "Ventic keeps your library on this device. Carrying it to another screen is the backup file below.": "Si Ventic ha adahi i library-mu gi este na device. Para un chule' para otro screen, i backup fail gi sanpapa' i chalan.",
  "Ventic searches nothing by itself. A source is a URL you add here, pointing at a server that answers with things to play. What a source offers, and whether you have the right to play it, is between you and whoever runs it.": "Si Ventic taya' ha aligao maisa. Un source un URL ni un na'hålom guini, ni ha fanu'i un server ni ha oppe ni kosas para u ma play. Håfa ha ofresi un source, yan kao guaha derechu-mu para un play, entre hågu yan i taotao ni ha maneha.",
  "Ventic speaks the {protocol}. Any Stremio addon URL works here — paste the {link} link or the {manifest} address and it'll be trimmed to what's needed.": "Si Ventic ha kuentos i {protocol}. Kada Stremio addon URL funsiona guini — pega i {link} na link pat i {manifest} na address ya u ma korta asta i nesesario.",
  "Ventic will send it the title you're looking for and play what it hands back. Only add servers you trust — this one is not run by, or checked by, this app.": "Si Ventic ha na'hånao guihi i titulu ni un aligao ya ha play håfa ha nå'i tåtte. Na'hålom ha' i server siha ni un konfia — ti este na app ha maneha pat ha chek este.",
  "Ventic {version} is out": "Gaige esta si Ventic {version}",
